  "_comment": "Negative. A DISABLED closure claim dressed up as a denied assertion about a triple. #ClosureClaim composes #AssertionEnvelope and deliberately NOT #AssertionProposition, but absence from the CUE shape is not enforcement: the compiled JSON Schema emits no additionalProperties:false and RDF is open-world, so without a shape this validates and the record that is supposed to carry no weight at all becomes a denial. Caught by rkaf:ClosureClaimNoPolarityShape, the mirror of rkaf:RelationChangeEventNoPolarityShape (spec/rkaf-analysis.md 6.1)."
